# env.required — design
#
# CLASSIFIED BY TRACING THE DOWNSTREAM GATE, not the access idiom.
# The scripts read `os.environ.get("GEMINI_API_KEY")` (looks optional — just
# normalizes missing→None), but every image-generation entry point hard-gates
# on it and produces NO useful result without it:
#
#   scripts/icon/generate.py:193  if not GEMINI_API_KEY: print("...not set"); return None
#   scripts/icon/generate.py:290  if not GEMINI_API_KEY: print("...not set"); return []
#   scripts/logo/generate.py:145  if not GEMINI_API_KEY: print("...not set"); return None
#   scripts/cip/generate.py:213   if not api_key: print("GEMINI_API_KEY or GOOGLE_API_KEY not set"); return None
#
# The key flows straight into the only network call: genai.Client(api_key=...).
# Icon and logo generation accept GEMINI_API_KEY ONLY (no alternative), so the
# skill's generation capability is dead without it → REQUIRED.
#
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY
